{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01862","headline":"杂曲歌辞 邯郸才人嫁爲厮养卒妇 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 邯郸才人嫁爲厮养卒妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾本丛台女，扬蛾入丹阙。\n自倚颜如花，宁知有凋歇。\n一辞玉阶下，去若朝云没。\n每忆邯郸城，深宫梦秋月。\n君王不可见，惆怅至明发。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}